worst-case prompt: 56719 tokens  (692.4% of 8192, 43.27% of 131072)

worst Explorer prompt  : 8455 (shrinkable: send fewer library compounds per call)
worst debate/PI prompt : 56719 (structural: grows with rounds and candidates)

VERDICT: the debate protocol does NOT fit txgemma-27b-chat's context.
  The overrun is in the accumulating roles, not the shrinkable one, so it
  cannot be fixed by trimming the candidate library. Orchestration needs a
  long-context model; txgemma stays in the design as a bounded tool.

